OL,3,GNEWSAYouth justice service inadequate,
OL,4,Ainspectors rule
OL,5,
OL,6,FInspectors have found "significant
OL,7,Fweaknesses" in the care of children in
OL,8,Fthe justice system.
OL,10,FBradford Youth Justice Service received
OL,11,Fan "inadequate" rating after an
OL,12,Finspection from His Majesty's
OL,13,FInspectorate of Probation, which made
OL,14,Fnine recommendations to improve the
OL,15,Fservice.
OL,17,FBradford Youth Justice Service (YJS)
OL,18,Fworks with children and young people
OL,19,Faged 10 to 17 who have broken the law,
OL,20,For are at risk of doing so, and is run
OL,21,Fby the Bradford Children and Families
OL,22,FTrust.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
